{"about_the_game":"Game-Kun: Input Challenge is a reaction-based hiscore mini game. Test your reflexes with your gamepad. Earning badges aids your progress through a course of challenge levels. Unlock skins and other characters to enhance the fun! Can you reach the final level and compete for the ultimate hiscore?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Over 30 Skins to unlock at Launch and more Coming Soon!*<br />\r\nUnlock &quot;Game-Kun&quot; alternate colours and other characters along the way, can you collect them all?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe hope you like pressing buttons!<br />\r\nThis game is not for &quot;passive-gamers&quot; or &quot;screen watchers&quot;!<br />\r\nGet ready to increase your reaction times, improve your controller skills and level up your brains!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPerfect for quick pick up and play sessions, or for playing while waiting for that pesky update to download...<br />\r\nTons of replay value and potentially hours of play time while you compete to dominate the leaderboards!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame-Kun: Input Challenge features a number of brain-busting input challenges including:<br />\r\nRegular Inputs<br />\r\nDon't Press Inputs<br />\r\nColour Trick Inputs<br />\r\nDouble Inputs<br />\r\nTriple Inputs<br />\r\nMulti-Combination Inputs<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDeveloper: We are a small 2 person team trying to provide people with fun games that won't exist unless we make them...<br />\r\nIf you pick up a copy of this game that would be awesome, we really appreciate your support!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"cd70de0bc14f3588301a5922aaa18f58ef04b9b7.jpg","localized_name":"Baby Steps","name":"Baby Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1283660/cd70de0bc14f3588301a5922aaa18f58ef04b9b7.jpg"},{"icon":"733b22dc40d28a8285b216334a50c23738301975.jpg","localized_name":"Walking","name":"Walking","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1283660/733b22dc40d28a8285b216